+```text
+/usr/bin/python3 -B /home/yayoi/orca/workspaces/Strata/sycl/bench/results/2026-10-15-pr6-recovery-audit/own-metric-enumeration-v1/main_controller.py --mode build --manifest <external-reviewed-build-seal> --manifest-sha256 <external-build-seal-sha256> --reviewed-package-sha256 <external-package-sha256> --run-id <fresh-build-run-id>
