+
+The controller's exact compiler path comes from the original inventory's historical LLVM install and links the exact loader filename, without SYCL flags, contexts or device compilation. The source specifies `-std=c++17 -O2 -Wall -Wextra -Werror -fno-sycl`, the existing header directory, `-ldl` and a private output path. Compilation is its own owned run; it cannot launch enumeration. Main must inspect the compiler result/warnings, source/recipe/binary identity and loaded dependency expectations before selecting the binary from the completed build receipt.
